  "body": "Stylish and beautifully presented, this spacious family home offers modern, low-maintenance living in a sought-after Eastern Bays location. High stud ceilings enhance the sense of space and light throughout.\r\n\r\nThe open-plan living area features a gas fireplace and flows to a sunny deck with LouvreTec-covered outdoor entertaining and a private, easy-care garden, creating an ideal space for year-round enjoyment. The designer kitchen features quality finishes and a clever slide-open scullery, while a separate media room with home theatre wiring provides excellent flexibility for family living.\r\n\r\nFour oversized bedrooms include an impressive master suite with an oversized walk-in wardrobe and generous ensuite. A striking entrance atrium, hardwood flooring, double glazing and excellent storage further enhance the home.\r\n\r\nSet well back from the road on a freehold title, the property also offers a double internal-access garage and two additional off-street car parks.\r\n\r\nEnjoy walking distance to Madills Farm and Kohimarama Beach, with zoning for St Thomas's, Selwyn College and St Ignatius School.\r\n\r\nA superb family home in the heart of the Eastern Bays.\r\n\r\nAUCTION: 4pm, Wednesday 2nd December 2026\r\nIN ROOMS: 451 Mt Eden Road (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nDean Tuffley is proud to be recognised as one of Ray White's leading salespeople nationally. Built on hard work, integrity, and exceptional client service, his reputation is defined by outstanding results and an unwavering commitment to achieving the very best outcome for every client.",
